{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-hq-app-a-01","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"2","surface":"hq","area":"hq/app","refs":["F-hq-104"],"severity":"S3","title":"The 'Trial ended, not paid' tile also counts gyms whose paid plan ran out","what":"On All gyms, the tile and the filter called 'Trial ended, not paid' (hint: call them about a plan) also hold gyms that already had a paid monthly or yearly plan whose paid time has passed. Those gyms are not on a trial and already have a plan, so the count and the words are wrong for them.","expected":"Gyms whose paid plan ran out are counted and named on their own (for example 'Plan payment due'), apart from gyms whose free trial ended.","evidence":["apps/hq/public/logic.js:481","apps/hq/public/logic.js:502-503","apps/hq/public/app.js:325"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"ended-tile-mixes-lapsed-plans","who":"MettleUp team","how_often":"whenever a paying gym is late with its next payment","fix_line":"Split the ended count into trial ended and plan payment due, each with its own words","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-hq-app-a-02","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"2","surface":"hq","area":"hq/app","refs":["F-hq-129","F-hq-130"],"severity":"S4","title":"Payment amounts are rounded to whole rupees, so a small gap can read as zero","what":"HQ rounds every money amount to whole rupees. A payment a few paise below the price shows 'Underpaid: Rs 0 less', and a payment of Rs 1,499.50 against a Rs 1,499 price shows two prices that do not match what was sent.","expected":"When two amounts differ by less than a rupee, HQ shows the paise so the difference is visible.","evidence":["apps/hq/public/logic.js:55-58","apps/hq/public/logic.js:843","apps/hq/public/logic.js:851-853","apps/hq/public/logic.js:898"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"money-rounding-hides-paise-gap","who":"MettleUp team","how_often":"rarely (only when an amount has paise)","fix_line":"Show paise whenever paid and asked amounts differ","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
